OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADetective raped by colleague says Met
OL,4,Ahandling of case 'like being raped
OL,5,Aagain'
OL,6,
OL,7,FLinda has post-traumatic stress
OL,8,Fdisorder (PTSD) because of the attack
OL,9,Fand sought damages from the Met for
OL,10,Ffailing to protect her from Carrick.
OL,11,FThe lengthy civil case left her feeling
OL,12,Fsuicidal, she says.
OL,14,FThe "worst thing", she says, was when
OL,15,Flawyers acting for the Met commissioner
OL,16,Fchallenged the severity of her PTSD on
OL,17,Fthe basis that she had been raped only
OL,18,Fonce.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
