OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA magnitude 7.0 earthquake has hit a
OL,7,Fmountainous region in Tibet, killing at
OL,8,Fleast 16 people and injuring dozens,
OL,9,Faccording to Chinese state media.
OL,11,FThe centre of the quake hit Baqen
OL,12,FCounty in the Nagqu region on Thursday
OL,13,Fnight, Xinhua reported, citing the
OL,14,Flocal emergency management bureau.
OL,16,FThe county - located in what China
OL,17,Fcalls the Tibet Autonomous Region after
OL,18,Fannexing it in the 1950s - is 400km
OL,19,F(250 miles) north-east of the region's
OL,20,Fcapital, Lhasa.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
