OL,3,APowerful earthquake hits Tibet killing
OL,4,A16 people, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities have declared the incident
OL,7,Fan emergency and deployed rescue teams
OL,8,Fto the affected area, where 65 others
OL,9,Fhave been injured, including 11 people
OL,10,Fwith severe injuries.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
