OL,3,ATrump says Musk has restored access to
OL,4,AUkraine's Starlink network
OL,5,
OL,6,FMusk previously denied he was behind
OL,7,Fthe slowdown, which affects Ukraine's
OL,8,Fability to use drones to attack Russian
OL,9,Ftargets in Ukraine and protect itself
OL,10,Ffrom attacks.
OL,12,FTrump refused to be drawn on a report
OL,13,Fthat he had called Musk to ask him to
OL,14,Flift restrictions to the service, but
OL,15,Fsaid: "Bottom line, he put it back."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
